# Cross-Agent Rule Bridge

This project stores its canonical engineering rules in `.cursor/rules/`.

For any agent working in this repository:

1. Use `.cursor/rules/README.md` as the entry point.
2. Read the most relevant subsystem rule files before editing code.
3. Keep new reusable project rules inside `.cursor/rules/` instead of scattering them across tool-specific files.
4. Keep the root `AGENTS.md` aligned with `.cursor/rules/README.md` so Codex and other agents follow the same source of truth.
